From f3c8e266b2dfd744df93d0caf7e6761d94514a7a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: guacamoleb CI <ci@localhost>
Date: Sun, 20 Sep 2026 22:48:17 +0500
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] guacamoleb: enable KernelSU-Next (legacy, manual hooks)
 in defconfig

KernelSU-Next (legacy, non-GKI) with manual in-tree hooks.

Hook mode is `manual` because CONFIG_KPROBES is not set on this kernel and
KernelSU-Next's kprobe/tracepoint hook requires
KPROBES + KRETPROBES + HAVE_SYSCALL_TRACEPOINTS.

KernelSU-Next must be pinned to a *-legacy tag on 4.14: the mainline `next`
line (>= v3.3.0) uses syscall_fn_t, which was introduced on arm64 only in
4.19 and therefore does not compile here.

CONFIG_EXT4_FS, CONFIG_MODULES and CONFIG_KALLSYMS_ALL are already =y in the
sm8150 perf defconfig. CONFIG_OVERLAY_FS is enabled by that defconfig too;
only REDIRECT_DIR / XINO_AUTO / TMPFS_XATTR are added here, as KernelSU uses
overlayfs for Magisk-style module mounting.

---
 arch/arm64/configs/vendor/sm8150-perf_defconfig | 14 ++++++++++++++
 1 file changed, 14 insertions(+)

diff --git a/arch/arm64/configs/vendor/sm8150-perf_defconfig b/arch/arm64/configs/vendor/sm8150-perf_defconfig
index f4e51e8..3c55610 100644
--- a/arch/arm64/configs/vendor/sm8150-perf_defconfig
+++ b/arch/arm64/configs/vendor/sm8150-perf_defconfig
@@ -723,3 +723,17 @@ CONFIG_CRYPTO_GHASH_ARM64_CE=y
 CONFIG_CRYPTO_AES_ARM64_CE_CCM=y
 CONFIG_CRYPTO_AES_ARM64_CE_BLK=y
 CONFIG_CRYPTO_AES_ARM64_NEON_BLK=y
+
+# ============================================================
+# KernelSU-Next (legacy, non-GKI, manual hooks) — guacamoleb
+# ============================================================
+CONFIG_KSU=y
+# CONFIG_KSU_DEBUG is not set
+# Manual in-tree hooks: CONFIG_KPROBES is not set on sm8150,
+# so the kprobe/tracepoint hook path is unavailable.
+CONFIG_KSU_MANUAL_HOOK=y
+# CONFIG_KSU_KPROBES_HOOK is not set
+# Required for KSU module mounting (Magisk-style overlayfs).
+CONFIG_OVERLAY_FS_REDIRECT_DIR=y
+CONFIG_OVERLAY_FS_XINO_AUTO=y
+CONFIG_TMPFS_XATTR=y
-- 
